/* Every color, radius, and type metric below resolves through a custom
   property that tokens.ts writes from resources/jusprin/ui/design-tokens.json:
   --<group>-<name> for colors, --radius-<name> for radii, --font-<role> for
   the `font` shorthand of each type role and --font-code for code. Padding,
   margin, and gap stay literal but must sit on the spacing scale. styles.test.ts
   fails the build on any literal outside those rules. */

/* The product font ships with OrcaSlicer, but it is registered as a private
   font of the native process and WKWebView renders in a separate process
   that cannot see it. A Latin subset is embedded so the Agent page uses the
   same face as the native shell; CJK text falls through to the system font. */
@font-face {
